            "review_text": "Abellada P\n1 contribution\n0\n\"From the moment we walked in, the atmosphere of Sen Restaurant enveloped us in warmth and anticipation. The attentive s\nApr 2024 • Couples\n\"From the moment we walked in, the atmosphere of Sen Restaurant enveloped us in warmth and anticipation. The attentive staff guided us through the menu with expertise, recommending their standout dishes. Each bite was a revelation of flavor, showcasing the culinary mastery behind every dish. The service was impeccable, with staff members seamlessly attending to our needs. Overall, Sen restaurant exceeded our expectations, providing a dining experience that will linger in our memories. We can't wait to return and indulge in their delicious offerings again\nRead more\nWritten April 29, 2024\nAuthentic Hanoi Boutique Hotel\nThank you for sharing your wonderful experience at Sen Restaurant.\n\nWe are thrilled to hear that from the moment you walked in, you felt the warmth and anticipation that our atmosphere aims to provide. It’s delightful to know that our attentive staff guided you expertly through the menu and that you enjoyed the standout dishes. Your kind words about the impeccable service and culinary mastery behind each dish mean a lot to us.\n\nWe look forward to welcoming you back and providing another memorable dining experience soon.\nRead more\nWritten May 27, 2024\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
